00:27:50.243 --> 00:27:51.778
¿Mi declaración?

00:27:51.845 --> 00:27:53.480
Que le darás a tu emperador...

00:27:53.581 --> 00:27:54.714
Ajá.

00:27:54.848 --> 00:27:56.950
